## 4.1 Carga y guardado de los días transcurridos

### scrAnalisis — OnVisible

```
=Set(varAnaIni; Coalesce(dtpAnaIni.SelectedDate; DateAdd(Today(); -365; TimeUnit.Days)));;
Set(varAnaFin; Coalesce(dtpAnaFin.SelectedDate; Today()));;
Select(btnRecalcDias);;
